---
title: Secuencia — Transferencia fallida y compensación (Fase 2)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant T as Transaction
    participant A as Account
    participant P as Payment
    participant N as Notification & Audit

    G->>MQ: transaction.transfer.requested
    MQ->>T: transaction.transfer.requested

    alt Cliente sin KYC verificado
        T->>T: proyección KYC ≠ VERIFIED → FAILED (KYC_NOT_VERIFIED)
        T->>MQ: transaction.failed + transaction.status.changed (FAILED)
        Note over T,A: No se publica transaction.created: Account nunca reserva fondos.

    else Fondos insuficientes o cuenta inactiva
        T->>MQ: transaction.created + transaction.status.changed (PENDING)
        MQ->>A: transaction.created
        A->>A: disponible − saldo mínimo < monto + comisión
        A->>MQ: account.funds.rejected (INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS / ACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND_OR_INACTIVE)
        MQ->>T: account.funds.rejected
        T->>T: FAILED + motivo
        T->>MQ: transaction.failed + transaction.status.changed (FAILED)
        Note over A: El saldo no se modifica.

    else Pago rechazado después de reservar (compensación)
        T->>MQ: transaction.created + transaction.status.changed (PENDING)
        MQ->>A: transaction.created
        A->>MQ: account.funds.reserved
        MQ->>T: account.funds.reserved
        T->>T: PROCESSING
        MQ->>P: account.funds.reserved
        P->>P: límite / monto inválido, o simulado FAILURE (10 %) / TIMEOUT (5 %, 3 s)
        P->>MQ: payment.rejected (PAYMENT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED / INVALID_AMOUNT / EXTERNAL_FAILURE / TIMEOUT)
        par Transaction compensa
            MQ->>T: payment.rejected
            T->>T: COMPENSATING · guarda motivo PAYMENT_*
        and Account libera la reserva
            MQ->>A: payment.rejected
            A->>A: reservedBalance −= monto · reserva RELEASED
            A->>MQ: account.funds.released
        end
        MQ->>T: account.funds.released
        T->>T: COMPENSATED
        T->>MQ: transaction.compensated + transaction.status.changed (FAILED)
        Note over A: El débito nunca se aplicó: el saldo original queda intacto.<br/>TIMEOUT no se reintenta: se compensa igual que un rechazo.
    end

    MQ->>N: todos los eventos (mismo correlationId)
    N->>N: audita, clasifica y notifica
    Note over G,T: El frontend consulta GET /api/transfers/:correlationId y muestra<br/>el motivo (failureReason) y qué puede hacer el cliente.
